menu "Testing"

config STM32_USE_TESTING
	bool "On-device unit-test helpers"
	default n
	help
	  Header-only ASSERT_*/EXPECT_* + TestRunner (testing/unit_test.hpp),
	  no exceptions or heap. The programmable mock buses (testing.mock)
	  are a source module the consumer adds to its own CXX_MODULES file
	  set and are not gated here.

endmenu
